[2025-10-22 20:38:31.465688] STATS: Encoding/Decoding Formulas:
[2025-10-22 20:38:31.465689] STATS: 
[2025-10-22 20:38:31.465690] STATS: ENCODING: S → class_id
[2025-10-22 20:38:31.465691] STATS:   1. Sort speaker IDs: S' = sorted(S)
[2025-10-22 20:38:31.465692] STATS:   2. Find lexicographic index of S'
[2025-10-22 20:38:31.465693] STATS: 
[2025-10-22 20:38:31.465694] STATS: DECODING: class_id → S
[2025-10-22 20:38:31.465695] STATS:   1. Find k: Σ(j=0 to k-1) C(5,j) ≤ class_id < Σ(j=0 to k) C(5,j)
[2025-10-22 20:38:31.465696] STATS:   2. Reconstruct combination from remaining index
[2025-10-22 20:38:31.465697] STATS: 
